WEBVTT

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.010
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:31.360
<i>I still want to keep feeling my</i>
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:39.090
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:45.230
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:50.010
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:57.710
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:04.690
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:12.620
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:20.290
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.970
"Bokuto Station"

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.020
How am I going
to ask her?

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:51.790
"I have tickets to a movie. Would
you accompany me?"

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.490
No, that's too stiff.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:57.930
"Kobayakawa, how about catching
a flick next time you're off?"

00:01:58.580 --> 00:01:59.740
That's too casual...

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.570
Hey, Nakajima, what're you doing?

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.150
Koba... Kobayakawa!

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:05.540
What's the matter?

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:08.410
You've been pacing up and
down like a caged bear!

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.680
Uh, well...

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:10.950
Hi there.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.110
Detective Tokuno!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:13.190
Good morning.

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:14.920
Any new cases?

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:16.680
I've come to
ask a favor.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.290
A favor?

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.900
In that case, let's go
inside and talk.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.630
I never get
a break.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:33.710
FILE. 26
A RED DRESS
AND A KN1FE

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.670
"Traffic Section"

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:39.680
So what's this favor
you wanted to ask?

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:45.480
I've got a case that I'd like the
Traffic Section's help on.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.820
I understand! Detective
Tokuno...

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.650
...l, Natsumi Tsujimoto,
will do anything...

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.700
...and everything within my
power to assist you!

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:57.860
Actually, it's Aoi's
help that I need.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.160
Huh?

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.660
Me?

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.240
Yes.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.900
There've been a number
of crimes...

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.170
...committed at some parties
across the city.

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.850
All of the victims are young
and beautiful women.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.920
The perpetrator never injures his victims,
only slashes their dresses.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.520
He's a slippery
devil.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:55.560
Nobody's ever
spotted him.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.420
Ooh, he sounds
scary!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.990
Let's go catch
that creep!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.890
So what will Aoi have to...
you don't mean...

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.530
That's exactly
what I mean.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.430
She's going to dress up and
pose as one of the guests.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:09.100
Uh...

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.930
But that's too
dangerous!

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:13.370
That's right.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.340
That'd be too big a risk
for her to take.

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:21.940
But Aoi has experience
in vice, and...

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:23.580
Aoi!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.580
I'd like to
do it, sir.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.080
But...

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.850
Don't worry, I'm used
to this kind of thing.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:31.890
And there you have it.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.050
Aoi will go undercover.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.860
We also need one
more person.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:36.590
Hey, Nakajima!

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.930
Nakajima! Are you
listening?!

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:40.590
Yes!

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.200
You too!

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:43.270
Me too, what,
sir?

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.340
You'll be Aoi's
partner.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:49.280
You'll go to the party
as a couple.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.080
But, sir, I can't
do that!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.950
It doesn't matter what
you think...

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:57.180
...you're the only one tall enough
to go as her partner.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:01.150
If I went with her, it would look
like she was my mistress!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.350
But, sir...

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.890
You can do it,
Nakajima.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.330
Go with Aoi and
protect her.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.830
Kobayakawa...

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:13.770
The rest of us will
lend our support.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:14.600
Yes, sir!

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.530
Well? What do
you think?

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.200
Aoi! You look
gorgeous!

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:53.540
You're beautiful!

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.800
Thank you.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.880
We mere women just
can't measure up.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:05:59.910
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.880
Does this look
all right?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.850
Well, they say the tailor
makes the man.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.020
Pretty nice, Nakajima.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:07.110
Think so?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.780
I'm not used to getting
dressed up like this.

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:12.290
It really does suit you
though, Nakajima.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.720
Think so?

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.420
Well, we should get
going to the party.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.530
Uh, just a sec.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.600
Let me straighten
your tie for you.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.170
Gee, you really do look
like a couple!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.530
Quit saying stuff
like that!

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.670
By the way... How come you're
in a dress, Natsumi?

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:28.540
Why else?

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.040
I'm posing as
a guest...

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:33.980
...so I can mingle at the party
and keep an eye on Aoi.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.520
Right, Chief?

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:36.170
Yeah.

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:38.340
How come you get
to be a guest...

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.320
...and we have to
be waitresses?

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.190
Quit complaining!

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.420
Everybody's been cast
for the right part!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.030
That's not fair!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.690
Well? Are you
all set?

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:50.300
Yes, sir.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.040
We're all ready here.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.800
If anything happens, let
us know right away.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.570
I wonder if the perpetrator
will show?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:03.210
He must know that he can't
escape from a boat.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:05.140
That's what's strange
about him.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:10.750
He likes to cause disturbances
at well-secured parties...

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:14.890
This party cruise
fits the bill.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.490
Even so, how can we be sure
he's going to go for Aoi?

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:20.660
Don't worry about that.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.460
He goes for young,
gentle...

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.860
...beautiful women
in red dresses.

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:28.100
That's why Aoi's
in a red dress.

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.960
Anyway, keep
on your toes.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.600
He might be
onboard.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:33.830
Yes, sir.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:41.840
Cheers!

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:56.290
Here you are. Some
tasty appetizers?

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:57.430
Yum.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.040
It's not fair that Natsumi
gets to have all the fun.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.840
I wish I were
in her place.

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:10.000
Quit grumbling, and keep a
lookout for the criminal.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:11.080
Yeah.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:19.520
It doesn't look natural, just
standing here like this.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:20.350
It doesn't?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.020
We're undercover.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.290
We have to be careful
not to stand out.

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:27.820
Come on. Let's
dance.

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.060
I don't know how
to dance!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.560
What are you talking
about?

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:33.470
Silly, follow my lead,
and you'll be fine.

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:46.580
What a nice-looking
couple.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:23.480
Anything?

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.850
Nothing. We haven't
spotted him.

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.890
Maybe he's not even
on the boat.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.080
It's too early
to say.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.730
I'm exhausted.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.000
Dancing is a lot harder
than I thought.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.960
It's not hard when you've
done it a few times.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.160
Where are you going?

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.770
Just going to powder
my nose.

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:48.310
I won't be long.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:50.070
You stay there and
catch your breath.

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.270
Uh... Okay.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.080
See you soon.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:23.640
Where's Aoi?

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.370
Miyuki! Hurry,
help me!

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:28.210
Yoriko, do you know
where Aoi is?

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:30.750
What? Isn't she
with Nakajima?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:30.990
Whoah! Hey, help!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.320
Whoah! Hey, help!
No, not for a while.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:34.810
Excuse me.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.290
Would you mind if
I sat next to you?

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.330
Oh! No, not at all.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.790
Are you alone?

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:45.290
No, I'm here with
someone.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:48.400
Oh, what a shame.
Your girlfriend?

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:51.230
No, nothing
like that.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.840
Then would you give me the
pleasure of a dance?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:58.480
Sure!

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.580
Excuse me!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:00.550
Oh!

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.050
Would you care for
a drink, SIR?!

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.320
Yow! Ouch!
My shin!

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:09.950
Seems like I've come
at a bad time.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.890
What are you doing,
Kobayakawa?

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.190
Aoi's missing. Do you know
where she went?

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.740
She said she was just going
to powder her nose.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.200
I guess she has been
gone awhile.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.660
Quit looking so
frightened.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.130
I just like you,
that's all.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.070
That red
dress...

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.370
...looks good
on you.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.030
You're him, aren't you?

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:00.610
What?

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:01.910
I won't let you get away with this.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:04.210
Why do you keep targeting
young women?!

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:05.240
Because...

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:09.110
...I like them young and
beautiful, why else?!

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:16.550
Natsumi! Any
sign of her?

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:17.560
No, and she's
not inside.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.460
Something must have
happened to her!

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.560
Stop it!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.100
Let me go!

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:30.570
Don't fight it.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:31.730
Let go of me!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:32.880
Aoi!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.440
Whew!

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:44.750
A... Aoi!

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.180
Way to show
him!

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:50.450
Let me tell you, that's one
sensitive spot for sure.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.890
But I wonder if
I overdid it?

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.470
Nice work, officers.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.200
I had no idea it'd be this easy for
you to catch that criminal.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:10.440
It was nothing
really, sir!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:12.640
It's all thanks to Aoi's
quick thinking.

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.680
Not at all.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:18.120
Well, we'll wrap
this thing up.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:21.190
You all stay onboard and have
yourselves a good time.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.280
Can we?! Yahoo!

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:24.990
I wonder if there's
any food left?!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:27.760
Don't worry. There's tons!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:28.860
Come on, Chief!

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.670
Miyuki. Listen.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.770
Huh?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.040
But, Aoi...

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.080
I insist.

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:47.240
After all, we've caught the criminal. And
here we are on this romantic cruise.

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:48.910
So please, I want you
to enjoy yourself.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.830
Hey! Here comes
your partner.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.930
Go get her.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:17.650
Come on, go for it.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.010
P... Please.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.810
Thank you.

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.290
Smooth move, Aoi!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.230
Mmm! Good!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:40.290
Yeah! Delicious!

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.600
The sauce here is...
not bad!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.310
Yes! Very good!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:48.300
C'mon, have some!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.510
Don't eat too much,
Nakajima.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.650
Mmm. Great.
Very nice.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.350
Uh... Excuse me. Uh,
would you mind...

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.560
Excuse me,
sir. Sir?

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.920
Umm?

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:10.760
Hey.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:11.860
Where?

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:26.580
Kobayakawa.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.720
Yes?

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.110
That dress really
suits you.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.080
Thank you.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.560
Nakajima?!

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.860
Kobayakawa, excuse me!
I'm about to explode!

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.670
Gotta go, gotta go!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.340
Jeez.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.630
That man is
hopeless.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:58.280
Stop where
you are!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.810
Damn it!

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:05.790
I'm impressed.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:08.580
I guess things don't go so smoothly
when I'm dealing with a cop.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.930
You mistook...

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:14.120
...that pervert back
there for me.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:17.160
You mean you're the
real Dress Ripper?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.860
Precisely.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.060
Well, Mr. Dress
Ripper...

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.110
...this dress of mine is expensive,
and you're going to pay for it!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:26.980
Yeah, right!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.210
Miyuki, what are
you doing?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.450
Natsumi! This guy's the
real Dress Ripper!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.420
He is?! Why you...

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.010
You let go of her!

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.260
Aah! What is that?!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.530
Sleeping gas!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.670
You're going to be
my next victim.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.770
I can't let anyone
get in the way.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:07.410
Nobody can help
you now.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:09.080
Go ahead and scream,
if you want...

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.750
Scream, while I slash up that
pretty dress of yours.

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:17.120
Aah, your poor dress
is crying.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.260
Take this!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.930
What do you think you're doing,
causing all this ruckus?

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:25.570
Nakajima! He's got
sleeping gas!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.670
Look out!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:27.760
What?

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:39.410
Too bad. Did you think that your
white knight would save you?

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:48.880
Stop!

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:51.880
You're not through
with me, yet.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:54.800
Hey! Let go
of me!

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:58.330
Nakajima!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.300
Don't come any closer!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.440
Run away! Hurry
up, Kobayakawa!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.350
Stop that!

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.850
Look out!

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:15.950
I figured you'd
come to me.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.450
Now, which part should
I slice up next?

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:20.220
Let me go!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.360
What're you doing?!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:24.190
Hurry and run, Kobayakawa!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.950
Who knows what
he'll try next!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.100
Nakajima.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.430
Forget about me!

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.090
Just get out of here!
Please! Run for it!

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:36.300
Where do you think
you're going?!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.010
Damn you!

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:50.390
Quit getting
in my way!

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.850
How about a
nice long...

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.390
...permanent
snooze?!

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.120
Stop it!!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:18:59.960
Damn it!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:06.460
This time, you're dead
meat, buster!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.470
Die!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.440
I knew I should have
come back!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.380
Damn!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.520
Detective Tokuno!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:33.600
That other guy didn't
have a knife on him.

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:36.390
I had a funny feeling, so
I decided to come back.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.490
I'm just glad I made it on time.
Nice work, you two.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:56.140
Thanks, Nakajima.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.150
Dig in...

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.790
I can't eat another bite...

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:38.290
How long do I have
to keep this up?

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:40.020
Would you like
some help?

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.670
How'd I end
up here?

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.000
Lucky me!

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.650
Yow!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.350
Sorry. Did that hurt?

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:15.550
No.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:17.820
Hey! Look at that,
Nakajima.

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:18.800
Isn't it beautiful?

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:19.270
Yeah.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:31.610
I'm just... so glad
you weren't hurt.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:35.250
Thanks, Nakajima.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:01.880
<i>Every time I fall</i>
<i>out of love...</i>

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:12.490
<i>... everything that I see</i>
<i>turns monochrome.</i>

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:19.380
<i>We often used to go see the</i>
<i>games at the stadium...</i>

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:29.510
<i>... but the good old days mean</i>
<i>nothing to me anymore.</i>

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:43.480
<i>Even after you've gone, I still wanna</i>
<i>tell the world what it is that I love.</i>

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:51.760
<i>Looking up to the sky, I try</i>
<i>holding back the tears.</i>

00:22:51.830 --> 00:23:00.340
<i>Flags were moving in the wind and</i>
<i>things seemed brighter yesterday.</i>

00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:08.370
<i>Looking up to the sky, we used</i>
<i>to talk about our dreams.</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:17.940
<i>No matter how far out of reach they seemed,</i>
<i>dreams could come true, or so it felt.</i>

00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:25.430
<i>Tell me that that fire in your</i>
<i>eyes was not a lie.</i>

00:23:27.560 --> 00:23:28.930
"License to Terrify"

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:29.370
"The Bodunan Driving Academy"

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:31.560
I'm going to learn how
to drive a car!

00:23:31.730 --> 00:23:33.930
Huh?! No way!

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.870
But if you can drive
a car, then...

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:38.630
Miyuki, say something!

00:23:38.810 --> 00:23:40.710
Well, she's certainly
enthusiastic...

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:42.370
It's inevitable...

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:45.110
The end of the world
as we know it!

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.340
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 27...

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:48.880
..."The ABCs Of Driving."

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:52.020
What?! What's wrong
with it?!
